@startuml
' Designation: proposed design; accepted in the 2026-10-23 design conversation.
' Supporting specification: ../../.scratch/assignment-workflow/spec.md
' Acceptance and rendering record: README.md
!pragma layout smetana
title Proposed installation and workspace boundaries
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction
package "Public source repository" {
  component "Skill instructions, scripts,\ntemplates, synthetic examples" as Source
}
package "User-level skill installation\n(not an assignment repository)" {
  component "Installed skill copy" as Installed
}
package "Separate local assignment Git repository" {
  component "Planning agent" as Agent
  artifact "Materials, worked solution, plan,\nmailbox packets, reports, Git history" as Work
}
Source .down.> Installed : install / update
Agent .up.> Installed : read instructions; invoke helpers
Agent -down-> Work : write within explicit workspace
note bottom of Work
One repository per assignment.
Store separately from skill source
and installed skill directories.
end note
@enduml
